

Prugramma pulisce.


>> Veggy := Ughjettu novu.
Veggy quandu: ['novu'] fà: {
	>> v := sè novu.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy quandu: ['init'] fà: { propiu veggies := 0. }.

Veggy quandu: ['carrots:'] fà: { :a propiu veggies := a. <- Nunda. }.
Veggy quandu: ['carrots'] fà: { <- propiu veggies. }.
Veggy quandu: ['+'] fà: { :f
	>> n := Veggy novu.
	n carrots: (f carrots + propiu veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy quandu: ['testu'] fà: { <- propiu veggies testu.
}.

Numeru quandu: ['carrots'] fà: {
	>> x := Veggy novu.
	x carrots: sè. <- x.
}.

Numeru quandu: ['add:and:'] fà: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Esciuta scrive: q, linea-nova.
